WEBVTT

00:22:57.079 --> 00:23:01.788
I've been deeply influenced by something
that I did very early in my career.

00:23:02.079 --> 00:23:06.204
When I was 22 years old, I set
up an interviewing system for

00:23:06.204 --> 00:23:12.496
the Israeli army. It was to determine
suitability for combat units.

00:23:14.121 --> 00:23:19.496
And the interview system that I
designed broke up the problem

00:23:19.788 --> 00:23:23.788
so that you had fixed rates that
you were interviewing about,

00:23:24.121 --> 00:23:29.204
you're asking factual questions
about each trade at the time

00:23:29.329 --> 00:23:33.079
and you were scoring each trade
once you had completed